WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.875
Scene one.

2
00:00:00.875 --> 00:00:05.888
The kit's manifest gives each daily
check one row, and the workbook one tab.

3
00:00:05.888 --> 00:00:09.982
Ten tabs read tables in the Sentinel
workspace, among them the domain

4
00:00:09.982 --> 00:00:14.650
controllers on the Active Directory tab,
and the request-driven admin changes.

5
00:00:14.650 --> 00:00:15.900
Two are link-outs.

6
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:20.800
Entra Health's alerts live in the admin
center and in e-mail, not in Log Analytics,

7
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:23.862
and their G C C availability
is not yet specified,

8
00:00:23.862 --> 00:00:27.537
so the tab sends the operator
there instead of pretending.

9
00:00:27.537 --> 00:00:31.375
And the catalog tasks
live in the I T S M tool.

10
00:00:31.375 --> 00:00:36.840
Three more tabs are partial: grants,
admin changes, and the log review queue.
